    "title": "Why Your First $100,000 Is the Hardest (And What Happens After)",
    "hook": "Why does money seem to grow faster after the first $100K?",
    "structure_id": "k70_longform_first_100k"
  },
  "fps": 30,
  "width": 1920,
  "height": 1080,
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "s0",
      "narration": "Why does money seem to grow faster once you cross one hundred thousand dollars?",
      "duration_sec": 5.0,
      "visual": {
        "type": "image",
        "motion": "ken_burns"
      },
      "data": null,
      "beat_role": "body"
    },
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "narration": "It's not magic. It's math -- and understanding it can change how you save for the rest of your life.",
      "duration_sec": 5.0,
      "visual": {
        "type": "image",
        "motion": "ken_burns"
      },
      "data": null,
      "beat_role": "body"
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "narration": "Meet John. He's twenty-seven, works a normal job, and like most people, saving money never quite feels like it's working.",
      "duration_sec": 5.0,
      "visual": {
        "type": "image",
        "motion": "ken_burns"
      },
      "data": null,
      "beat_role": "body"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "narration": "The paycheck comes in. The bills go out -- rent, groceries, the usual list.",
      "duration_sec": 5.0,
      "visual": {
        "type": "image",
        "motion": "ken_burns"
      },
      "data": null,
      "beat_role": "body"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "narration": "After everything, there's not much left over. Some months, almost nothing at all.",
      "duration_sec": 5.0,
      "visual": {
        "type": "image",
        "motion": "ken_burns"
      },
      "data": null,
      "beat_role": "body"
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "narration": "This is where most people start -- and where a lot of people stay stuck.",
      "duration_sec": 5.0,
      "visual": {
        "type": "image",
        "motion": "ken_burns"
      },
      "data": {
        "kind": "bar_compare",
        "title": "John's monthly budget",
        "points": [
          {
            "label": "Income",
            "value": 3400.0,
            "emphasis": "normal"
          },
          {
            "label": "Expenses",
            "value": 3350.0,
            "emphasis": "primary"
          },
          {
            "label": "Left to save",
            "value": 50.0,
            "emphasis": "normal"
          }
        ],
        "prefix": "$",
        "decimals": 0,
        "abbreviate": false,
        "highlight": 2,
        "note": "Illustrative example"
      },
      "beat_role": "body"
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "narration": "So why does saving the very first bit of money feel so much harder than the rest?",
      "duration_sec": 5.0,
      "visual": {
        "type": "image",
        "motion": "ken_burns"
      },
      "data": null,
      "beat_role": "body"
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "narration": "The math is simple: if income barely covers expenses, there's nothing left over. Every dollar is already spoken for before it arrives.",
      "duration_sec": 5.0,
      "visual": {
        "type": "image",
        "motion": "ken_burns"
      },
      "data": null,
      "beat_role": "body"
    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "narration": "So John does something small. He trims one expense, and puts the difference aside -- fifty dollars a paycheck.",
      "duration_sec": 5.0,
      "visual": {
        "type": "image",
        "motion": "ken_burns"
      },
      "data": null,
      "beat_role": "body"
    },
    {
      "id": "s9",
      "narration": "It's not much. But for the first time, it isn't zero.",
      "duration_sec": 5.0,
      "visual": {
        "type": "image",
        "motion": "ken_burns"
      },
      "data": null,
      "beat_role": "body"
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "narration": "Weeks turn into months. The habit matters more than the amount.",
      "duration_sec": 5.0,
      "visual": {
        "type": "image",
        "motion": "ken_burns"
      },
      "data": null,
      "beat_role": "body"
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "narration": "Ten thousand dollars. Still not life-changing on its own. But it's real, and it's his.",
      "duration_sec": 5.0,
      "visual": {
        "type": "image",
        "motion": "ken_burns"
      },
      "data": {
        "kind": "bar_compare",
        "title": "John's savings so far",
        "points": [
          {
            "label": "Month 1",
            "value": 50.0,
            "emphasis": "normal"
          },
          {
            "label": "Month 12",
            "value": 1000.0,
            "emphasis": "normal"
          },
          {
            "label": "Year 3",
            "value": 10000.0,
            "emphasis": "primary"
          }
        ],
        "prefix": "$",
        "decimals": 0,
        "abbreviate": false,
        "highlight": 2,
        "note": "Hypothetical example, consistent monthly saving"
      },
      "beat_role": "body"
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "narration": "Sarah's story looks a little different, but the shape of it is the same.",
      "duration_sec": 5.0,
      "visual": {
        "type": "image",
        "motion": "ken_burns"
      },
      "data": null,
      "beat_role": "body"
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "narration": "A household budget, a family to plan around, and the same basic question: what's actually left at the end of the month?",
      "duration_sec": 5.0,
      "visual": {
        "type": "image",
        "motion": "ken_burns"
      },
      "data": null,
      "beat_role": "body"
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "narration": "A banker put it simply: the first ten or twenty thousand dollars is the hardest, because you're building the habit before you see the reward.",
      "duration_sec": 5.0,
      "visual": {
        "type": "image",
        "motion": "ken_burns"
      },
      "data": null,
      "beat_role": "body"
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "narration": "There's no interest check coming yet. No compounding doing the work for you. It's just discipline, showing up month after month.",
      "duration_sec": 5.0,
      "visual": {
        "type": "image",
        "motion": "ken_burns"
      },
      "data": null,
      "beat_role": "body"
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "narration": "Twenty-five thousand dollars in. The number is bigger now -- but the feeling of slow progress often hasn't changed much.",
      "duration_sec": 5.0,
      "visual": {
        "type": "image",
        "motion": "ken_burns"
      },
      "data": {
        "kind": "bar_compare",
        "title": "The long middle stretch",
        "points": [
          {
            "label": "Year 3",
            "value": 10000.0,
            "emphasis": "normal"
          },
          {
            "label": "Year 5",
            "value": 25000.0,
            "emphasis": "primary"
          },
          {
            "label": "Year 7",
            "value": 50000.0,
            "emphasis": "normal"
          }
        ],
        "prefix": "$",
        "decimals": 0,
        "abbreviate": false,
        "highlight": 1,
        "note": "Hypothetical example, consistent monthly saving"
      },
      "beat_role": "body"
    },
    {
      "id": "s17",
      "narration": "Zoom out, and this same story is happening across an entire economy -- millions of people, at every stage of it.",
      "duration_sec": 5.0,
      "visual": {
        "type": "image",
        "motion": "ken_burns"
      },
      "data": null,
      "beat_role": "body"
    },
    {
      "id": "s18",
      "narration": "Markets moving, businesses growing, paychecks landing every two weeks in every direction.",
      "duration_sec": 5.0,
      "visual": {
        "type": "image",
        "motion": "ken_burns"
      },
      "data": null,
      "beat_role": "body"
    },
    {
      "id": "s19",
      "narration": "This is an investor -- someone thinking less about saving the next dollar, and more about what money can start doing on its own.",
      "duration_sec": 5.0,
      "visual": {
        "type": "image",
        "motion": "ken_burns"
      },
      "data": null,
      "beat_role": "body"
    },
    {
      "id": "s20",
      "narration": "Because somewhere past that first big milestone, something genuinely changes: the money you already have starts helping earn the next dollar.",
      "duration_sec": 5.0,
      "visual": {
        "type": "image",
        "motion": "ken_burns"
      },
      "data": null,
      "beat_role": "body"
    },
    {
      "id": "s21",
      "narration": "Here's a simple, hypothetical example. Assume a seven percent average annual return -- a common long-run historical stock market estimate, never guaranteed.",
      "duration_sec": 5.0,
      "visual": {
        "type": "image",
        "motion": "ken_burns"
      },
      "data": {
        "kind": "bar_compare",
        "title": "Same 7% return, different starting amounts (hypothetical)",
        "points": [
          {
            "label": "$10,000 earns",
            "value": 700.0,
            "emphasis": "normal"
          },
          {
            "label": "$100,000 earns",
            "value": 7000.0,
            "emphasis": "primary"
          }
        ],
        "prefix": "$",
        "decimals": 0,
        "abbreviate": false,
        "highlight": 1,
        "note": "Illustrative only -- returns are never guaranteed"
      },
      "beat_role": "body"
    },
    {
      "id": "s22",
      "narration": "Same percentage. Seven times the dollars. That's the entire secret behind why a bigger principal starts to feel like it's working harder for you.",
      "duration_sec": 5.0,
      "visual": {
        "type": "image",
        "motion": "ken_burns"
      },
      "data": null,
      "beat_role": "body"
    },
    {
      "id": "s23",
      "narration": "It's not that the math changes at one hundred thousand dollars. It's that compounding needs a real base to work with -- and now there's one.",
      "duration_sec": 5.0,
      "visual": {
        "type": "image",
        "motion": "ken_burns"
      },
      "data": null,
      "beat_role": "body"
    },
    {
      "id": "s24",
      "narration": "None of this happens overnight, and none of it is guaranteed. Markets go up and down, and past growth never promises future growth.",
      "duration_sec": 5.0,
      "visual": {
        "type": "image",
        "motion": "ken_burns"
      },
      "data": null,
      "beat_role": "body"
    },
    {
      "id": "s25",
      "narration": "But the pattern holds for almost everyone who gets there: the first hundred thousand is mostly about behavior. What comes after leans more on math.",
      "duration_sec": 5.0,
      "visual": {
        "type": "image",
        "motion": "ken_burns"
      },
      "data": null,
      "beat_role": "body"
    },
    {
      "id": "s26",
      "narration": "John isn't rich. He's not done. But he's not stuck at zero anymore, either -- and that's the part that was actually hard.",
      "duration_sec": 5.0,
      "visual": {
        "type": "image",
        "motion": "ken_burns"
      },
      "data": null,
      "beat_role": "body"
    },
    {
      "id": "s27",
      "narration": "Wherever you're starting from, the first step is the same one John took: find the number that isn't zero, and protect it.",
      "duration_sec": 5.0,
      "visual": {
        "type": "image",
        "motion": "ken_burns"
      },
      "data": null,
      "beat_role": "body"
    }
  ]
}